#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:5
#: 1623847424fa4c0db0e5efa43c4b24c8
msgid "Using SITL with Webots Python"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 Webots Python 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:7
#: 7b21132b9fa34046b6ae535ba1345ab2
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's python-based Webots implementation is a cross-platform "
"simulation tool that allows running ArduPilot without risking real-life "
"crashes. This page goes over how to set up and use Webots with ArduPilot's "
"SITL as well as touching on how to create new vehicles and worlds."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 基于 Python 的 Webots 实现是一种跨平台仿真工具，可在不冒真实坠机风险的情况下运行 "
"ArduPilot。本页介绍如何配置并使用 Webots 与 ArduPilot SITL，以及如何创建新飞行器和世界。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:19
#: 8f9d2bd713e345b3a26b16234f145b40
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:20
#: 0bc4a0eaa969455aa9114404bbd609a5
msgid ""
"Webots itself can be downloaded from `www.cyberbotics.com "
"<https://www.cyberbotics.com/>`__. If there is any trouble with installation"
" see `Webots' install guide <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/installation-"
"procedure>`__ for further guidance."
msgstr ""
"Webots 可从 `www.cyberbotics.com <https://www.cyberbotics.com/>`__ "
"下载。如有安装问题，请参阅 `Webots 安装指南 <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/installation-"
"procedure>`__ 获取进一步指导。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:27
#: 270892de6eca4e789ddfcdd5e9299c5f
msgid ""
"The Webots python implementation was built for Webots 2023a and is not "
"backward compatible. Newer versions should also work, however."
msgstr "Webots Python 实现是为 Webots 2023a 构建的，不向后兼容。但较新版本应该也能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:32
#: 8e451cac69304d18a9686a70087450e0
msgid "Running the Iris Example"
msgstr "运行 Iris 示例"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:33
#: 1fb621a0593a485d98943555cc7f6223
msgid ""
"The following assumes you have already successfully set up your ArduPilot "
"dev environment (see `Building the code "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-code.html>`_)."
msgstr ""
"以下操作假设您已成功配置 ArduPilot 开发环境（参见 `构建代码 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-code.html>`_）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:37
#: 281e5a014d6e480d9bd395606cc33d9e
msgid ""
"Run Webots and open "
"``/path/to/ardupilot/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots_Python/worlds/iris.wbt``"
" (``File`` > ``Open World``). If everything is working you should see the "
"simulation time advancing and no errors in the console (red warnings are "
"fine)."
msgstr ""
"运行 Webots 并打开 "
"``/path/to/ardupilot/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots_Python/worlds/iris.wbt``（``File``"
" > ``Open World``）。如果一切正常，您应看到仿真时间在推进，控制台中没有错误（红色警告是正常的）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:42
#: cd10d49d6171471db08966cb0c8c8ca2
msgid ""
"Run the SITL with the following command, replacing ``/path/to/`` with your "
"local absolute path to ardupilot::"
msgstr "使用以下命令运行 SITL，将 ``/path/to/`` 替换为您本地到 ardupilot 的绝对路径：："

