"cmd and looking for the IP under the WSL adapter. You may also need to add "
"WSL's IP found with ``hostname -I`` to ``iris.wbt`` so it looks something "
"like this::"
msgstr ""
"在 WSL2 中运行 SITL 且 Webots 在 Windows 中运行时，需要在上述命令中添加类似 ``--sim-"
"address=172.x.x.1`` 的选项向 SITL 提供 Windows 的 IP 地址。可以在 cmd 中运行 ``ipconfig`` "
"并查找 WSL 适配器下的 IP 来获取确切 IP。您可能还需要将通过 ``hostname -I`` 找到的 WSL IP 添加到 "
"``iris.wbt`` 中，如下所示：："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:66
#: 452c5beee2d14f44ab26b6a01e0b8a80
msgid ""
"If all goes well you should see ``Connected to ardupilot SITL`` in the "
"Webots console. At this point, you should be able to use MAVProxy (in the "
"SITL terminal window) or a GCS to fly the drone around."
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，您应在 Webots 控制台看到 ``Connected to ardupilot SITL``。此时，您可以使用 MAVProxy（在 "
"SITL 终端窗口中）或地面站来飞行无人机。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:72
#: 80595db61e354cb28bf56c8391d2cf63
msgid "Other Example Worlds"
msgstr "其他示例世界"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:74
#: ba47eea558ef4c70ba31ff9954369e39
msgid "``iris.wbt`` implements a basic quadcopter."
msgstr "``iris.wbt`` 实现了一个基本四旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:75
#: 3bd86e4794c14dbd9f44443e447e072a
msgid ""
"``iris_camera.wbt`` implements a camera on a quadcopter. See "
"``example_camera_receive.py`` in the scripts folder for one way to get "
"access to the camera."
msgstr ""
"``iris_camera.wbt`` 在四旋翼上实现了摄像头。参见脚本文件夹中的 ``example_camera_receive.py`` "
"了解访问摄像头的一种方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:78
#: 2eef7fe345614682930e7208a6b56500
msgid ""
"``iris_depth_camera.wbt`` implements a camera that sees depth rather than "
"color. The example camera script can also receive these images."
msgstr "``iris_depth_camera.wbt`` 实现了一个感知深度而非颜色的摄像头。示例摄像头脚本也可以接收这些图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:80
#: 1404ea9f298b43c4a7f722c266fc1008
msgid ""
"``pioneer3at.wbt`` implements a pioneer3at rover. For the SITL command, run "
"it with ``Rover`` instead of ``ArduCopter`` and ``pioneer3at.parm`` instead "
"of ``iris.parm``."
msgstr ""
"``pioneer3at.wbt`` 实现了一个 pioneer3at 无人车。对于 SITL 命令，将 ``ArduCopter`` 替换为 "
"``Rover``，将 ``iris.parm`` 替换为 ``pioneer3at.parm``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:83
#: 53602038573b4915804089fa628c1b75
msgid ""
"``crazyflie.wbt`` implements a crazyflie quadcopter. Run the SITL command "
"with ``crazyflie.parm`` instead of ``iris.parm``."
msgstr ""
"``crazyflie.wbt`` 实现了一个 crazyflie 四旋翼。将 SITL 命令中的 ``iris.parm`` 替换为 "
"``crazyflie.parm``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:85
#: dd98a54086944609b73b48883ddd223e
msgid ""
"``crazyflie_double.wbt`` implements two crazyflie drones in a swarm. For the"
" SITL command, run it with ``crazyflie.parm`` instead of ``iris.parm`` and "
"additionally add ``-n 2 --auto-sysid``."
msgstr ""
"``crazyflie_double.wbt`` 实现了两架 crazyflie 无人机的集群。对于 SITL 命令，将 ``iris.parm`` "
"替换为 ``crazyflie.parm``，并额外添加 ``-n 2 --auto-sysid``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:91
#: 241538249d6a47c5a276edaae55e631b
msgid "Creating a New World"
msgstr "创建新世界"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:92
#: 9c2b32f6a8bd41ad9955b8654bcae931
msgid ""
"Creating a new world can be done by copying an example world (such as "
"``iris.wbt``) and making desired changes. Prebuilt models (called `PROTOs "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto>`__) can be added directly "
"through Webots by pressing ``CTRL+SHIFT+A``, or by adding them directly into"
" the world file (`see options in documentation "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/objects>`__)."
msgstr ""
"可以通过复制示例世界（如 ``iris.wbt``）并进行所需修改来创建新世界。预构建模型（称为 `PROTO "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto>`__）可以通过按 ``CTRL+SHIFT+A`` 直接在 "
"Webots 中添加，或直接将其添加到世界文件中（`参阅文档中的选项 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/objects>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:99
#: e673584d4ba5451f830c93d79157c2e8
msgid ""
"If you want to go a bit further, check out `Webots' tutorials "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/tutorial-1-your-first-simulation-in-"
"webots>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果想深入了解，请查阅 `Webots 教程 <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/tutorial-1-your-"
"first-simulation-in-webots>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:103
#: f72d042cf61f4b66b87bb314f6db87d7
msgid ""
"An important parameter to set in every new world is the ``basicTimeStep`` "
"parameter in the WorldInfo object. This parameter should be set to 1 or 2, "
"as it represents how many milliseconds the simulation should delay between "
"physics timesteps. Setting this value any higher causes ArduPilot's main "
"loop to run too slow."
msgstr ""
"每个新世界中都需要设置 WorldInfo 对象中的 ``basicTimeStep`` 参数。该参数应设置为 1 或 "
"2，表示仿真在物理时间步之间应延迟多少毫秒。设置更高的值会导致 ArduPilot 主循环运行过慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:111
#: 70b033ccf43a4498882020df4a600e66
msgid "Creating a New Vehicle"
msgstr "创建新飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:112
#: 119c2dc5cda240958fbf3a4c79d44e38
msgid ""
"An ArduPilot vehicle in Webots is a `Robot "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/robot>`__ object that uses the "
"``ardupilot_vehicle_controller.py`` controller (found in the ``controllers``"
" directory). This controller is run when the simulation is started and is "
"responsible for connecting to the SITL and passing it Webots sensor "
"information. Note that to do this it assumes that the Robot object has an "
"`Accelerometer <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/accelerometer>`__, "
"`Gyro <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/gyro>`__, `InertialUnit "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/inertialunit>`__, and `GPS "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/gps>`__."
msgstr ""
"Webots 中的 ArduPilot 飞行器是一个使用 ``ardupilot_vehicle_controller.py`` 控制器（位于 "
"``controllers`` 目录）的 `Robot <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/robot>`__"
" 对象。该控制器在仿真启动时运行，负责连接到 SITL 并向其传递 Webots 传感器信息。请注意，为此它假设 Robot 对象具有 `加速度计 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/accelerometer>`__、`陀螺仪 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/gyro>`__、`惯性单元 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/inertialunit>`__ 和 `GPS "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/gps>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:123
#: 81645109e490457e9297d53ba58bf37a
msgid ""
"To create a new vehicle that can be used in multiple worlds, like the Iris "
"model, we can create a `PROTO "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto>`__ file which will describe "
"the vehicle (a Robot object) and be importable into any world. The simplest "
"way to do this is to copy the ``iris.proto`` file in the ``protos`` folder "
"and edit or remove components (such as propellers, mesh, and the extension "
"slot). If you want to start from scratch, you can look at the `documentation"
" for creating a PROTO file <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto-"
"definition>`__."
msgstr ""
"要创建可在多个世界中使用的新飞行器（如 Iris 模型），可以创建一个 `PROTO "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto>`__ 文件来描述飞行器（Robot "
"对象），并使其可导入任何世界。最简单的方法是复制 ``protos`` 文件夹中的 ``iris.proto`` "
"文件，并编辑或删除组件（如螺旋桨、网格和扩展插槽）。如果想从头开始，可以参阅 `创建 PROTO 文件的文档 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/proto-definition>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-python.rst:131
#: a52a117085034ab8a2f0bee23194c1f3
msgid ""
"Of particular note, the Robot object has a property called "
"``controllerArgs`` which are passed to the controller when the simulation is"
" run, allowing us to specify traits of the vehicle such as motor names, "
"count, and directions. The full list of available arguments are documented "
"in ``ardupilot_vehicle_controller.py``."
msgstr ""
"特别值得注意的是，Robot 对象有一个名为 ``controllerArgs`` "
"的属性，在仿真运行时传递给控制器，允许我们指定飞行器的特性，如电机名称、数量和方向。所有可用参数的完整列表记录在 "
"``ardupilot_vehicle_controller.py`` 中。"
